    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60304" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρωσσός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>water-pail, pitcher</i>, mostly
			in pl., <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				96
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				478
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				1173
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				89
			</span></i>: in sg., <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				13.46
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>cinerary urn</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πένθιμε κρωσσέ</span>”
