					Erinn.
					5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Mosch.
				4.34
			</span></i>: also fem., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">με . . ὀλίγη ἐκρύψατο κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
					697a
				</span></i>
			.</div>
